# A CAT-iq (NG-DECT Part 3) handset dials out, wideband, with call status
# on (TS 102 527-3 §7.4.6.4): the base's answers carry <<CALL-INFORMATION>>.
# Identities are made up.
hold 80 a8 03 11 22 33 44
callstatus 1

# {CC-SETUP} as in pp-call.trace, but <<BASIC-SERVICE>> wideband speech.
pp 03 05 05 07 80 a8 03 11 22 33 44 06 07 a0 a5 00 01 23 45 60 e0 88 2c 07 30 33 30 31 32 33 34 a1
fp 83 02 7e 06 01 00 81 02 01 83
fp 83 07 7c 04 90 02 00 84 7e 06 01 00 81 02 01 85

# {CC-RELEASE}, normal.
pp 03 4d e2 00
fp 83 5a
